---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | The McGennis Family"
  description="Privacy Policy for TheMcGennisFamily.com - Learn how we collect, use, and protect your personal information."
  type="website"
>
  <section class="bg-soho-white py-20 px-4">
    <div class="container mx-auto max-w-4xl">
      <div class="bg-soho-white rounded-2xl shadow-lg p-8 md:p-12">
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-display font-bold mb-4 text-gray-900 tracking-tight">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="text-gray-500 mb-12 pb-8 border-b border-gray-200">Last Updated: December 22, 2025</p>

        <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-display font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4">Introduction</h2>
      <p>
        The McGennis Family ("we," "our," or "us") operates TheMcGennisFamily.com.
        This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and safeguard
        your information when you visit our website.
      </p>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-display font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4">Information We Collect</h2>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mt-6 mb-3">Automatically Collected Information</h3>
      <p>
        When you visit our website, we automatically collect certain information
        about your device, including:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Browser type and version</li>
        <li>Operating system</li>
        <li>IP address</li>
        <li>Pages visited and time spent on pages</li>
        <li>Referring website addresses</li>
      </ul>

          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mt-6 mb-3">Information You Provide</h3>
      <p>We collect information you voluntarily provide when you:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Subscribe to our newsletter (email address, name)</li>
        <li>Submit a contact form (name, email, message)</li>
        <li>Comment on blog posts (name, email, comment content)</li>
      </ul>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-display font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4">How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <p>We use the information we collect to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Improve our website and user experience</li>
        <li>Send you our newsletter (if you've subscribed)</li>
        <li>Respond to your inquiries</li>
        <li>Analyze website traffic and usage patterns</li>
        <li>Prevent fraud and maintain website security</li>
      </ul>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-display font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4">Third-Party Services</h2>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mt-6 mb-3">Google Analytics</h3>
      <p>
        We use Google Analytics to analyze website traffic. Google Analytics uses
        cookies to collect information about how you use our website. For more
        information, see
        <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          Google's Privacy Policy
        </a>.
      </p>

          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mt-6 mb-3">Newsletter Service</h3>
      <p>
        If you subscribe to our newsletter, your email address is stored by our
        email service provider. We will never sell or share your email address
        with third parties for marketing purposes.
      </p>

          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mt-6 mb-3">Giscus Comments</h3>
      <p>
        Our blog uses Giscus for comments, which is powered by GitHub Discussions.
        When you comment, your GitHub account information is used. See
        <a href="https://github.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          GitHub's Privacy Statement
        </a> for details.
      </p>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-display font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4">Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        Our website uses cookies to improve your browsing experience. Cookies are
        small files stored on your device. You can configure your browser to refuse
        cookies, but some features of our website may not function properly.
      </p>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-display font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4">Your Rights</h2>
      <p>You have the right to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Access the personal information we hold about you</li>
        <li>Request correction of inaccurate information</li>
        <li>Request deletion of your personal information</li>
        <li>Opt-out of email communications (unsubscribe link in emails)</li>
        <li>Object to processing of your personal information</li>
      </ul>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-display font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4">Data Security</h2>
      <p>
        We implement reasonable security measures to protect your personal
        information. However, no method of transmission over the internet is 100%
        secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.
      </p>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-display font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4">Children's Privacy</h2>
      <p>
        Our website is not directed to children under 13. We do not knowingly
        collect personal information from children under 13. If you believe we have
        collected information from a child under 13, please contact us.
      </p>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-display font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4">Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you of
        any changes by posting the new Privacy Policy on this page and updating the
        "Last Updated" date.
      </p>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-display font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4">Contact Us</h2>
      <p>
        If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Location:</strong> Jefferson City, Missouri</li>
        <li><strong>Website:</strong> <a href="https://themcgennisfamily.com/contact">Contact Form</a></li>
      </ul>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-display font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4">California Privacy Rights (CCPA)</h2>
      <p>
        If you are a California resident, you have specific rights regarding your
        personal information under the California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA):
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Right to know what personal information is collected</li>
        <li>Right to know if personal information is sold or disclosed</li>
        <li>Right to opt-out of the sale of personal information</li>
        <li>Right to deletion of personal information</li>
        <li>Right to non-discrimination for exercising your rights</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        <strong>Note:</strong> We do NOT sell your personal information.
      </p>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-display font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4">GDPR Compliance (European Users)</h2>
      <p>
        If you are located in the European Economic Area (EEA), you have rights
        under the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR):
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Right to access your personal data</li>
        <li>Right to rectification of inaccurate data</li>
        <li>Right to erasure ("right to be forgotten")</li>
        <li>Right to restrict processing</li>
        <li>Right to data portability</li>
        <li>Right to object to processing</li>
      </ul>
          <p>
            Our lawful basis for processing your data is consent (newsletter signups,
            contact forms) and legitimate interests (website analytics).
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
